{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a simple peasant living in medieval times, working for your feudal lord. One day, you discover the recipe for brewing beer. This changes your life - improve your brewing skills, unlock new sales channels, and expand your product across growing territories. But be careful! The world that discovers beer will never be as peaceful as before.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brew</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737930/extras/974fec56e46e05be25e698693acb66ca.poster.avif?t=1772508912\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737930/extras/974fec56e46e05be25e698693acb66ca.webm?t=1772508912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737930/extras/974fec56e46e05be25e698693acb66ca.mp4?t=1772508912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with the simplest <strong>beer</strong> made from bread. Then unlock increasingly advanced <strong>brewing technologies</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, sell your beer hand-to-hand, then open <strong>sales points</strong> at markets and eventually establish your own <strong>tavern</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy premises and equipment. Hire assistants and <strong>automate</strong> production. Conquer new lands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019d be wrong to think the world won\u2019t change after learning about beer. Public order will be disrupted. You and everyone else must be more careful at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist now!</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3737930?t=1772508912","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3737930?t=1772508912","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737930/c925737d584f5d1d960a886354ce93976f6343bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772508912","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737930/c925737d584f5d1d960a886354ce93976f6343bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772508912","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a simple peasant living in medieval times, working for your feudal lord. One day, you discover the recipe for brewing beer. This changes your life - improve your brewing skills, unlock new sales channels, and expand your product across growing territories. But be careful! The world that discovers beer will never be as peaceful as before.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brew</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737930/extras/974fec56e46e05be25e698693acb66ca.poster.avif?t=1772508912\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737930/extras/974fec56e46e05be25e698693acb66ca.webm?t=1772508912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737930/extras/974fec56e46e05be25e698693acb66ca.mp4?t=1772508912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with the simplest <strong>beer</strong> made from bread. Then unlock increasingly advanced <strong>brewing technologies</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, sell your beer hand-to-hand, then open <strong>sales points</strong> at markets and eventually establish your own <strong>tavern</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy premises and equipment. Hire assistants and <strong>automate</strong> production. Conquer new lands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019d be wrong to think the world won\u2019t change after learning about beer. Public order will be disrupted. You and everyone else must be more careful at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist now!</strong></h2>","developers":["Tas Simple Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737930/f402ac53ca76491d11b0839cb8a5690913e297d0/header.jpg?t=1772508912","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3737930/1108928501/1b9279d87f7f3264a6b2b2d872ad693a6a2151ec/1751977767/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751979996","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3737930/1108928501/1b9279d87f7f3264a6b2b2d872ad693a6a2151ec/1751977767/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751979996","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3737930/1108928501/1b9279d87f7f3264a6b2b2d872ad693a6a2151ec/1751977767/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751979996","id":257166473,"name":"Drinking Medieval Gameplay Trailer2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257166473/0a0564bc10a53fac08aeaba949c4f34c8a8a6ce9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751979996"}],"name":"Drinking Medieval","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3GHz 4-Core or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</